PART III -- THE KERNEL.  The carried kernel as published is INADMISSIBLE by the programme's own
            bounded-boost theorem (an attained supremum has Delta' = 0).  It is repaired here.
======================================================================================================================
    fit to nu_RAR carried (THE_ACTION section 3)   : C = 0.647610 (held at the kernel's own ceiling), p = 1.7538, a2 = 0.9335  ->  max |d log10 g| = 0.0111 dex over s in [1e-4, 1e4]
    fit to exponential carrier (recipe I1 / L11)   : C = 0.367879 (held at the kernel's own ceiling), p = 0.8438, a2 = 13.3082  ->  max |d log10 g| = 0.0299 dex over s in [1e-4, 1e4]
